STRING 489
// Abilities: A00V (Apprehend), Researchubertip (Tooltip - Learn - Extended)
{
Traps a target enemy unit in a net, interrupting their spell casts, reducing their Attack Speed by 20%/30%/40%/50% and preventing them from moving for 7/8/9/10 seconds. Reduced duration against Heroes (to 3.25/3.5/3.75/4 seconds), as per usual.
